values ('f6a7b8c9-0d1e-4f71-8a11-2b3c4d5e6f01', 'translation-and-interpretation', 'Translation and Interpretation', 'Students analyze translation and interpreting tasks by purpose, audience, ethics, genre, domain, and risk; produce Spanish-English translations that control register, grammar, terminology, style, and cultural context; apply terminology research, corpora, CAT/MT literacy, and revision workflows; perform introductory consecutive, sight, simultaneous, and remote interpreting with appropriate protocols and reflection; and assemble a professional portfolio of polished translations, interpreting evidence, revision notes, and decision-making commentary.');

