 listening and chunking"}, {"id": "406f4e64-b637-4f07-b308-9185c3283d6e", "type": "concept", "title": "Main ideas, details, logic, and speaker intent"}, {"id": "ba120e1c-a84f-4b89-a1b7-1393833eb25c", "type": "concept", "title": "Memory drills and reformulation"}], "description": "Students build the cognitive foundation for accurate interpreting."}, {"id": "b4389ac3-dd26-4c5d-9c75-d87be1055cf7", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Note-taking systems", "children": [{"id": "7efa749a-5bd3-4448-80cd-8e9a71bb7c44", "type": "concept", "title": "Symbols, arrows, structure, and vertical layout"}, {"id": "ceccf6c4-35e2-48ae-b91b-b023511dfe08", "type": "concept", "title": "Numbers, names, dates, and specialized terms"}, {"id": "7a6e63c3-a68f-4d5f-afb2-2720c21dd6bb", "type": "concept", "title": "Practice from short to extended passages"}], "description": "This subtopic teaches notes as memory support rather than transcription."}, {"id": "2d525e00-1895-4790-a0c1-a402a1f39734", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Delivery and turn management", "children": [{"id": "852a425a-edb8-4db9-926b-7cca63ee2a84", "type": "concept", "title": "First-person interpreting and register matching"}, {"id": "69779545-9ef3-4c86-a1f4-7cb15ccc9573", "type": "concept", "title": "Voice, pace, eye contact, and confidence"}, {"id": "7f03b0d3-80e4-49cf-b1ca-bf58ac7c717f", "type": "concept", "title": "Clarification requests and ethical interruptions"}], "description": "Students learn to render speech clearly and manage the interaction professionally."}]}, {"id": "53212dba-512f-449c-92be-12c045afdd4d", "type": "topic", "title": "Sight Translation and Interpreting in Public-Service Contexts", "description": "Develops rapid comprehension and oral rendering for healthcare, legal, educational, social-service, and community settings.", "children": [{"id": "1f414ff4-5d26-488e-b2e2-8154fcb7bc00", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sight translation technique", "children": [{"id": "4c5fc56d-21f0-4722-9b68-0a7b048519ae", "type": "concept", "title": "Previewing, chunking, and anticipation"}, {"id": "e0f09278-2cf8-440e-8aad-12d39988b015", "type": "concept", "title": "Managing complex syntax and unknown terms"}, {"id": "1dc80721-e8c5-486d-be8a-ef90392b45b0", "type": "concept", "title": "Accuracy, completeness, and fluency under time pressure"}], "description": "Students practice quick analysis and oral rendering of written texts."}, {"id": "a91aed53-203c-4992-b7d9-71cebea96e6f", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Healthcare and social-service contexts", "children": [{"id": "ab5b0104-14d9-4e07-8a8b-d39df4a07735", "type": "concept", "title": "Intake forms, instructions, benefits, schools, and agencies"}, {"id": "4f8c6c0a-56e0-42ff-a62f-57185b9fa4d8", "type": "concept", "title": "Interpreter positioning and triadic communication"}, {"id": "1e4beb02-60b7-4426-9312-ea93e4fda91b", "type": "concept", "title": "Cultural humility and limited-English-proficient user rights"}], "description": "This subtopic emphasizes language access, safety, and role boundaries."}, {"id": "d4fcca3f-b9d1-4a8f-8a0e-6b4ce57e0664", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Legal and administrative contexts", "children": [{"id": "83593552-d3b4-434a-8d04-21de2541287a", "type": "concept", "title": "Hearings, affidavits, advisals, and official notices"}, {"id": "b0682e17-290b-4a94-b0cd-31ba73d0c8e7", "type": "concept", "title": "Accuracy, impartiality, and record integrity"}, {"id": "ae9a5916-b685-4e8b-a78e-d0750294bca7", "type": "concept", "title": "When to ask for repetition or clarification"}], "description": "Students learn to preserve register and consequences in high-stakes settings."}]}, {"id": "a66fe4e5-7e45-4e18-919f-80b020bfc16d", "type": "topic", "title": "Simultaneous, Remote, Accessibility, and Certification Standards", "description": "Introduces simultaneous and remote interpreting, relay, accessibility practices, professional standards, certification paths, and working conditions.", "children": [{"id": "1465487d-5521-4e55-b8c9-7cb52b