lity metrics, client-facing commentary, reflection, and a polished translation/interpreting portfolio.", "children": [{"id": "224c5dc7-631d-428d-abe6-1c41834fd275", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Revision and editing workflow", "children": [{"id": "2ddfbf2f-8ad7-4059-a2d8-7eb5f3d4783f", "type": "concept", "title": "Self-revision, bilingual review, monolingual review, and proofreading"}, {"id": "32994296-617f-49bd-a49a-b33e3edda283", "type": "concept", "title": "Accuracy, terminology, grammar, style, formatting, and completeness"}, {"id": "7c5edc75-be97-4084-af79-c25320ff9770", "type": "concept", "title": "Error typologies and quality rubrics"}], "description": "Students learn that professional translation is iterative and evidence-based."}, {"id": "562846ea-b237-429d-ab8b-8fc4736d61a2", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Peer review and client communication", "children": [{"id": "3fdced52-a058-4616-add6-f0ae29828191", "type": "concept", "title": "Translator queries and change logs"}, {"id": "a5244d5f-a352-4ed2-a644-da0c8572a1d4", "type": "concept", "title": "Giving and receiving critique"}, {"id": "4c528450-70a5-4fef-84b5-7cc96b5abe27", "type": "concept", "title": "Scope, deadlines, rates, and professionalism"}], "description": "This subtopic builds the habit of explaining decisions constructively."}, {"id": "acebbd68-5cf2-4d50-9cbc-1840c69092bb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Portfolio and reflective practice", "children": [{"id": "a25a996d-a5eb-4592-9072-8c3bb5fea456", "type": "concept", "title": "Before-and-after translations with commentary"}, {"id": "02af0b97-736e-4bdd-9406-fc046ede532e", "type": "concept", "title": "Interpreting recordings and self-assessments"}, {"id": "15564326-1b9d-4961-9530-104b4f6cf9d3", "type": "concept", "title": "Specialization statement, resume language, and next-step plan"}], "description": "Students finish with artifacts that demonstrate readiness for advanced work."}]}], "dbBacked": true}$trinjson$::jsonb,
